  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender Equality Trust Fund (GETF)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="IT">Gender Equality Trust Fund (GETF)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="IT">Contribuire all&apos;inclusione finanziaria delle Donne nel continente Africano ove oltre il 70% delle Donne &#xe8; esclusa dall&apos;accesso al credito specie per attivit&#xe0; di impresa.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To contribute to the financial inclusion of women in the Africa where over 70% of women are excluded from access to credit, especially for business activities.</narrative>
  </description>
